# Migrated from CUSTOM_DTS_PATH (flat file list) to CUSTOM_DTS_DIR:
# this kernel commit moved zynq.dtsi to arch/arm/boot/dts/xilinx/, so a
# flat-copied board .dtsi doing #include "zynq.dtsi" could not resolve
# it any more -- confirmed via a real, clean local build, not just
# inspection. board/tezuka/fishball7020/kernel-dts/xilinx/ mirrors that same
# xilinx/ subdirectory so our files land as real siblings of the
# kernel's own zynq.dtsi once BR2_LINUX_KERNEL_CUSTOM_DTS_DIR rsyncs
# it in (see linux/linux.mk: SYSTEM_RSYNC copies directory *contents*,
# preserving subdirectory structure). The old dts/ directory's vendored
# zynq-7000.dtsi is dropped here, not carried over: nothing in this
# board's own dtsi/dts chain ever #includes it -- it was dead weight
# in the old file list, and its content (u-boot,dm-pre-reloc /
# u-boot,config properties) is actually a U-Boot devicetree fragment,
# not a Linux kernel one, so it should not shadow the kernel's own
# real xilinx/zynq-7000.dtsi anyway.
BR2_LINUX_KERNEL_CUSTOM_DTS_DIR="$(BR2_EXTERNAL_PLUTOSDR_PATH)/board/tezuka/fishball7020/kernel-dts"
BR2_ROOTFS_OVERLAY="${BR2_EXTERNAL_PLUTOSDR_PATH}/board/tezuka/common/overlay_base ${BR2_EXTERNAL_PLUTOSDR_PATH}/board/tezuka/common/overlay_tezuka"
