# NOTE: the board dir below was fishball7010 (copy-paste from that board's
# defconfig) until this fix -- inert in practice since plutomaia.its is a
# generic template with no board-specific content (it /incbin/s plain
# filenames like "fishball.dtb"/"system_top.bit" that both boards produce
# under the same names in their own images/ dir), but wrong and fragile.
# Gave fishball7020 its own copy of that same template and pointed here at
